module jev_generation_trace_route_outcome_closure

input generation_trace_observation
input route_outcome_metric
input trace_metric_digest
input route_outcome_metric_digest
input route_record_digest
input decision_digest
input outcome_digest
input read_only
input non_authorizing

status BOUND generation trace and route outcome metric are linked
status DEFERRED generation trace or route outcome producer is deferred
status UNKNOWN missing, invalid, or unlinked evidence is preserved

field missing_stage
field target_stage
field reason
field closure_signal
field closure_digest

constraint metric_link_required
constraint observation_only
constraint no_improvement_claim
constraint no_execution
constraint no_authorization
constraint read_only
constraint no_edits
constraint no_command